:Namespace Lib
⍝ Common helpers shared by the code in this repo.  Docs: lib/README.md
⍝
⍝ Load it with one line (the `dyalog` command mounts lib/ at /apl-lib):
⍝     ⎕FIX'file:///apl-lib/Lib.apln'
⍝ then call  Lib.Str.Trim '  hi '   or   Lib.Stats.Mean 1 2 3
⍝
⍝ Under `dyalog test`, Lib is already loaded for the code being tested.

    ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1

    :Namespace Str
    ⍝ Text
        ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
        IsText←{(0=10|⎕DR ⍵)∧1≥|≡⍵}                ⍝ a character scalar or vector?
        Trim←{⍵/⍨(∨\m)∧⌽∨\⌽m←' '≠⍵}               ⍝ drop leading/trailing blanks
        Split←{⍺←' ' ⋄ (~⍵∊⍺)⊆⍵}                   ⍝ ⍺ separators (default blank) → pieces; empty pieces dropped
        Join←{⍺←' ' ⋄ 0=≢⍵:'' ⋄ s←,⍺ ⋄ ⊃{⍺,s,⍵}/⍕¨⍵}  ⍝ ⍺ separator between the items of ⍵
        Words←{(⍵∊⎕A,⎕C ⎕A)⊆⍵}                     ⍝ runs of (English) letters
        Lower←{⎕C ⍵}
        Upper←{1 ⎕C ⍵}
        Clip←{⍺≥≢⍵:⍵ ⋄ ((⍺-1)↑⍵),'…'}               ⍝ cut ⍵ to ⍺ characters, marking the cut
        Replace←{(from to)←⍺ ⋄ (from ⎕R to⍠('Regex' 0))⍵}  ⍝ 'old' 'new' Replace text (plain text, not regex)
        StartsWith←{⍺≡(≢⍺)↑⍵}                      ⍝ 'ab' StartsWith 'abc' → 1
        EndsWith←{⍺≡(-≢⍺)↑⍵}
    :EndNamespace

    :Namespace Stats
    ⍝ Numbers
        ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
        Mean←{(+/⍵)÷≢⍵}
        Median←{s←⍵[⍋⍵] ⋄ n←≢⍵ ⋄ Mean s[(⌈n÷2),1+⌊n÷2]}
        Mode←{u←∪⍵ ⋄ u⊃⍨⊃⍒+/⍵∘.=⍨u}                  ⍝ most frequent value (first, on a tie)
        SD←{(Mean(⍵-Mean ⍵)*2)*0.5}                 ⍝ population standard deviation
        Range←{(⌈/⍵)-⌊/⍵}
        Round←{⍺←0 ⋄ (⌊0.5+⍵×10*⍺)÷10*⍺}            ⍝ ⍺ decimal places (default 0); 2 Round = cents
        Percent←{⍺←1 ⋄ ⍺ Round 100×⍵÷+/⍵}           ⍝ each item as a % of the total
    :EndNamespace

    :Namespace Data
    ⍝ Namespaces as records, and JSON
        ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
        Record←{n←⎕NS'' ⋄ _←⍺{n⍎⍺,'←⍵'}¨⍵ ⋄ n}    ⍝ 'name' 'age' Record 'Ann' 41 → namespace
        Fields←{n←⍵.⎕NL ¯2 ¯9 ⋄ n[⍋↑n]}            ⍝ a namespace's variable names, sorted
        Get←{⍺←⍬ ⋄ (ns name)←⍵ ⋄ (⊂name)∊ns.⎕NL ¯2 ¯9:ns⍎name ⋄ ⍺}   ⍝ default Get ns 'name': ns.name, or ⍺ if missing
        ToJSON←{⍺←0 ⋄ 1(⎕JSON⍠('Compact'(~⍺)))⍵}   ⍝ 1 ToJSON x → pretty-printed
        FromJSON←{0 ⎕JSON ⍵}
    :EndNamespace

    :Namespace Sys
    ⍝ Environment, command line, files, time
        ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
        Env←{⍺←'' ⋄ v←2⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment'⍵ ⋄ 0=≢v:⍺ ⋄ v}   ⍝ 'default' Env 'NAME'
        Args←{1↓2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'}       ⍝ a script's arguments (script path left out)
        ScriptDir←{⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'}   ⍝ folder of the running script
        Exists←{⎕NEXISTS ⍵}
        ReadText←{⊃⎕NGET ⍵}
        ReadLines←{⊃⎕NGET ⍵ 1}
        WriteText←{⍺ ⎕NPUT ⍵ 1}                     ⍝ 'text' WriteText path (overwrites)
        Now←{ISO ⎕TS}                               ⍝ '2026-11-16 09:05:03'
        ISO←{(⍕⍵[1]),'-',(P ⍵[2]),'-',(P ⍵[3]),' ',(P ⍵[4]),':',(P ⍵[5]),':',P ⍵[6]}
        P←{¯2↑'0',⍕⌊⍵}
        Time←{t←⎕AI[3] ⋄ r←⍺⍺ ⍵ ⋄ ⎕←'took ',(⍕⎕AI[3]-t),' ms' ⋄ r}   ⍝ (Fn Time) arg: run and report
    :EndNamespace

:EndNamespace
